; sfab-ch10 inet-dns-res, zone the root: rendered from spec/profile-a.yaml by render/dns.py; edit the spec and run make render
; The lab has no way out: this resolver is authoritative for an empty root, so a name outside
; the platform's zone gets NXDOMAIN at once and no query leaves the lab.
$ORIGIN .
$TTL 300
@ IN SOA inet-dns-res.ai.tarnwick.example. hostmaster.ai.tarnwick.example. (
    400499476 ; serial, from the zone's data
    3600 ; refresh
    600 ; retry
    86400 ; expire
    60 ) ; negative answers
@                                 IN NS  inet-dns-res.ai.tarnwick.example.
inet-dns-res.ai.tarnwick.example. IN A   203.0.113.10 ; name server
